  "details": "1. Open VRChat.\n\n2. Open the winged menu, go to Profile.\n\n3. Add a language. \"Toki Pona\" is in the menu, but gives an error for \"Invalid Language Code\" when the user attempts to add it.\n\nThis behavior also occurs with Hebrew and Indonesian. \n\nConfirmed on PC and Quest\n\nThese options are not present on the website when editing the profile. I'm guessing these new languages just haven't been added in all the way on the back end?",
